        <h1>Career Strengths: The 8 <em>Work Signature</em> Types</h1>
        <p class="dek">Most career advice starts with job titles. This starts with you: the eight strength types behind how people actually do their best work, how to tell which one is yours, and the modern roles that fit it as AI reshapes the map.</p>
